<title>DENMARK: Danish Feb current account surplus 2.9 bln Dkk.</title>
<headline>Danish Feb current account surplus 2.9 bln Dkk.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's current account surplus in February 1997 was 2.9 billion crowns compared to a revised 4.0 billion crowns surplus in January, the national statistics office said on Monday.</p>
